              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AmyLiz23"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sooo good! I used 1/2 zest 1/2 lemon juice and I thought it was perfect! Served it over arugula and chicken cutlets for a dinner party we were having and everyone loved it! Also great because you don't need much to coat a salad, it's very light."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chele"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love it! Doubled the recipe but did not double the garlic or sugar (used 1 tsp each). I also used stone ground dijon mustard, and halved the white wine vin with lemon juice. It's tart but not too much and that's what I expect from a vinaigrette. It's light and very fresh tasting!",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-04T19:14:51.603Z"
          },
          {
