            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jessica53214"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great simple dressing! I use juice instead of peel so the dressing isn't so bitter. I also like to experiment with different mustards too. I used a chipolte mustard and added some cilantro to make a yummy southwest style dressing.",
            "datePublished": "2007-04-17T09:47:06.277Z"
